    "spawn_first_nudge_template": "配对审稿（{host_label}）：首轮工具前先 spawn 只读 reviewer（reviewer_lanes 闭集，fork_context=false）；主线程调研须另开独立 reviewer，explore 不计入证据。细则 skills/code-review-deep/SKILL.md",
    "spawn_first_nudge_host_labels": {
      "codex": "Codex",
      "claude": "Claude"
    },
    "spawn_first_nudge_by_host": {
      "cursor": "配对审稿（Cursor）：首轮工具前先 spawn 只读 reviewer（reviewer_lanes 闭集，fork_context=false）；主线程调研须另开独立 reviewer，explore 不计入证据；Task 省略 model、继承主会话，禁止默认 claude/sonnet。细则 skills/code-review-deep/SKILL.md",
